## Implementation
Rewrote all three guru handlers to the Task 19 specification:

### services/agents/guru-9001/handler.ts
- `const embedFn = createEmbedFn()` — transport, NEVER imports embed.ts
- `const { embedding } = await embedFn({tenantId, agent:'ISO9001Guru', ...})`
- `const chunks = await retrieve({..., queryVector: embedding})` — 45s budget (AOSS rule)
- `groundingContext: { source: chunks.join('\n---\n'), query: question.slice(0,1000) }`
- `locale: locale ?? 'en'`
- `standard: 'ISO9001'`

### services/agents/guru-14001/handler.ts
- Same pattern as guru-9001
- `standard: 'ISO14001'`

### services/agents/guru-45001/handler.ts
- Same pattern as guru-9001
- `standard: 'ISO45001'`

### Key design decisions:
- `query.slice(0,1000)` — truncation per Task 19 spec
- Chunks joined with `'\n---\n'` — citation construction delimiter
- Retrieval failure → silent catch → no groundingContext (dormant path)
- Removed old `queryVector` API argument (embed is now internal)
- Copilot handler: does not exist yet in codebase — BLOCKED on future spec. Only guru handlers wired.

